icable statement. D: Statement (i) is incorrect because justifying human dignity is a normative task, not purely explanatory. Statement (ii) is correct as questions regarding the existence of entities denoted by terms fall under ontology. Statement (iii) is considered descriptive in this context, as it investigates the factual/sociological relationship between law and economic structures." retrieved 3 passage(s): ['Mechanism (biology)', 'Scientific law', 'Ecosystem health']
