he landowner. Statement ii is incorrect because federal constitutional principles generally apply to cantons as well as the federation. Statement i describes a condition that is not a general principle of administrative law, making it likely incorrect or at least less definitively correct than iii. C: The provided reference passages do not contain information verifying any of the three legal statements regarding administrative law, Swiss constitutional law, or Roman treasure division. Consequently, none of the statements can be confirmed as correct based on the available text." retrieved 3 passage(s): ['Scientific law', 'Scientific law', 'Legal expert system']
